description:
This program is supposed to print the sum of the even numbers from 1 through 10 (expected output: 30), but it prints 25. Find the bugs and rebuild the corrected program.
```
public class EvenSum {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int total = 0;
        for (int i = 1; i < 10; i++) {
            if (i % 2 == 1) {
                total += i;
            }
        }
        System.out.println(total);
    }
}
```
